, "date": 1194307200, "platform": 6, "y": 2007, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 847, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/khrheggklcvjmt3tam4y.jpg"}, {"id": 846, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/xws8z9rb6g3ihpvyz9l5.jpg"}, {"id": 843, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/t3kdkcnyzaexzunsbesx.jpg"}, {"id": 844, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/incswzjg4ypq2wlqp0cj.jpg"}, {"id": 845, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ahneik35lprl8itxplnt.jpg"}], "slug": "supreme-commander-forged-alliance", "storyline": "The last days of man are at hand... Two years after the Infinite War the once great warring nations now lie in ruins, and humanity\u2019s hope for a brighter future is nothing but a bitter memory. A new, seemingly unstoppable enemy, supported by the zealots of The Order, now seeks to eradicate mankind: UEF, Aeon Loyalist, and Cybran alike. With their backs against the wall and staring into the abyss, the tattered remnants of Humanity\u2019s forces must put aside old hatreds and band together as they prepare to make one last desperate stand. One last chance. An alliance forged in blood, steel and hope, they turn to face the dark.", "summary": "Forged Alliance is a stand-alone expansion to the critically acclaimed RTS game Supreme Commander. The game adds a brand new alien race, the Seraphims, who have come back from outer space to wreak havoc on humanity. One campaign had been added, and the gameplay of the three existing factions has been significantly reworked.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/supreme-commander-forged-alliance", "videos": [{"id": 100868, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "vSh-5wuwMdk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vSh-5wuwMdk", "title": "Supreme Commander Forged Alliance Forever Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vS